{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>股評人連敬涵於節目中推介新秀麗(1910)，指銷售重回正增長，反映旅行需求改善，加上早前與旅遊品牌併購落地，本季增長確定性強，以及股東回報加碼，機構上調目標價都利好股價。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263YIFmnVA1A1795070760.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>連敬涵建議15.3元買入，目標價看17元，止蝕價定於14元。</p><p></p><p>新秀麗(1910)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$15.3</p><p>目標：$17</p><p>止蝕：$14</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4324.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RyArUIgep61795070810.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>股評人趙晞文推介華虹宏力(1347)，主要是季績指引勝預期，另外受惠國策，因此對國產晶圓代工需求增加。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202681JfXQI6jW1795070820.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>趙晞文認為股價回落至81元才買入，目標價看95元，止蝕價在70元。</p><p></p><p>華虹宏力(1347)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$81</p><p>目標：$95</p><p>止蝕：$70</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026o1DqaGdsi51795070833.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:43:52.524212+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:16.098276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:37:12.967677+00:00","content_hash":"74798975b2d2b016abe391cc4718b42f3fcbbab72f367e5231b641ca99d10511","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:43:52.524212+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}